#: routes/splash.py:25
msgid "That was a really good impression of a dying cat!"
msgstr "C'était une très bonne imitation de chat mourant !"

#: routes/splash.py:26
msgid "Thank God it's over."
msgstr "Dieu merci, c'est fini."

#: routes/splash.py:27
msgid "Pass the mic, please!"
